# Marks in table cells

| Item | Status | Note |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Addition | the {author="Claude (editor)" date="2026-10-30"++very ++}quick fox | plain |
| Deletion | the {author="Claude (editor)" date="2026-10-30"--brown --}fox | plain |
| Substitution | the {author="Claude (editor)" date="2026-10-30"~~quick~>fast~~} fox | plain |
| Comment | a cell{author="Claude (checker)" date="2026-10-30">>Is this right?<<} | plain |
| Highlight | {author="Claude (checker)" date="2026-10-30"==highlighted cell==} | plain |
| Pipe inside | {author="Claude (editor)" date="2026-10-30"~~a \| b~>c \| d~~} | escaped pipe |

